{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><p style=\"text-align: left;\">第一代「郭靖」白彪近年憑無綫處境劇《愛·回家之開心速遞》中「雷公」一角，以搞笑霸道的形象深入民心。雖然《愛回家》快將迎來大結局，但白彪依然活力十足、搞作多多，早前更宣布進駐內地社交平台小紅書，積極與年輕觀眾互動，開拓內地市場。</p><div class=\"image-block responsive-block\" data-bs-component=\"generic\" style=\"margin: 0px 0px 4px; border-radius: 8px; overflow: hidden; background: rgb(255, 255, 255); border: 1px solid rgb(228, 231, 237);\">\n<div class=\"image-container\" style=\"position: relative; width: 100%; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px;\">\n<img alt=\"螢幕截圖 2026-07-29 上午10.31.16.png\" src=\"https://tvb-vod-hk.oss-cn-hongkong.aliyuncs.com/uploads/image/2026/07/2026tnzzd25HkR1785294729.png\" style=\"width: 100%; max-width: 100%; height: auto; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px; display: block; object-fit: contain;\" title=\"螢幕截圖 2026-07-29 上午10.31.16.png\"/>\n</div>\n<div class=\"image-caption\" style=\"padding: 8px 12px; background: rgb(245, 247, 250); border-top-width: 1px; border-top-style: solid; border-top-color: rgb(228, 231, 237); font-size: 12px; color: rgb(96, 98, 102); line-height: 1.5;\">\n<span class=\"img-description\">小紅書圖片</span>\n</div>\n</div><p style=\"text-align: left;\">近日，白彪迎來 80 歲大壽。他在社交平台分享了一段於成都獲一班好友為其驚喜慶生的短片。片中可見，一班朋友極具心思，一早將餐廳佈置好「HAPPY BIRTHDAY」字樣的氣球。而壽星仔白彪當日身穿休閒服飾精神奕奕現身，看到驚喜派對更是笑逐顏開。</p><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><p style=\"text-align: left;\">當現場播起李克勤的經典快歌《護花使者》時，白彪立刻「舞王」上身，戴上造型誇張的花花眼鏡，跟著強勁節拍手舞足蹈，甚至擺出搞笑架勢，引得全場拍手歡呼，活力絕對不輸後生仔！</p><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><p style=\"text-align: left;\">到了切蛋糕環節，白彪更展現出其深厚的武打演員底子。他先是紮穩馬步，隨即大耍當年郭靖的招牌絕學「降龍十八掌」比劃一番，最後才蹲低身子，運氣呼出一口大氣將蠟燭吹熄，完美演繹何謂「寶刀未老」，瞬間勾起無數網民的武俠情懷！</p><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><p style=\"text-align: left; font-style: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: normal; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; white-space: normal; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; text-decoration: none; caret-color: rgb(0, 0, 0); color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">面對好友們的熱情祝賀，白彪在現場高呼：「我來到成都，嘩，今天是最開心的一晚！」片段曝光後，大批網民紛紛留言送上生日祝福，更大讚他老當益壯：「第一代郭靖果然犀利！」、「彪叔生日快樂，身體健康！」、「80 歲仲咁有魄力，真係好犀利！」</p><div class=\"image-block responsive-block\" data-bs-component=\"generic\" style=\"margin: 0px 0px 4px; border-radius: 8px; overflow: hidden; background: rgb(255, 255, 255); border: 1px solid rgb(228, 231, 237);\">\n<div class=\"image-container\" style=\"position: relative; width: 100%; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px;\">\n<img alt=\"螢幕截圖 2026-07-29 上午10.32.04.png\" src=\"https://tvb-vod-hk.oss-cn-hongkong.aliyuncs.com/uploads/image/2026/07/2026sEDeanKIdM1785294729.png\" style=\"width: 100%; max-width: 100%; height: auto; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px; display: block; object-fit: contain;\" title=\"螢幕截圖 2026-07-29 上午10.32.04.png\"/>\n</div>\n<div class=\"image-caption\" style=\"padding: 8px 12px; background: rgb(245, 247, 250); border-top-width: 1px; border-top-style: solid; border-top-color: rgb(228, 231, 237); font-size: 12px; color: rgb(96, 98, 102); line-height: 1.5;\">\n<span class=\"img-description\">小紅書圖片</span>\n</div>\n</div><div class=\"image-block responsive-block\" data-bs-component=\"generic\" style=\"margin: 0px 0px 4px; border-radius: 8px; overflow: hidden; background: rgb(255, 255, 255); border: 1px solid rgb(228, 231, 237);\">\n<div class=\"image-container\" style=\"position: relative; width: 100%; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px;\">\n<img alt=\"螢幕截圖 2026-07-29 上午10.32.44.png\" src=\"https://tvb-vod-hk.oss-cn-hongkong.aliyuncs.com/uploads/image/2026/07/2026a2WfcHVLPE1785294729.png\" style=\"width: 100%; max-width: 100%; height: auto; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px; display: block; object-fit: contain;\" title=\"螢幕截圖 2026-07-29 上午10.32.44.png\"/>\n</div>\n<div class=\"image-caption\" style=\"padding: 8px 12px; background: rgb(245, 247, 250); border-top-width: 1px; border-top-style: solid; border-top-color: rgb(228, 231, 237); font-size: 12px; color: rgb(96, 98, 102); line-height: 1.5;\">\n<span class=\"img-description\">小紅書圖片</span>\n</div>\n</div><div class=\"image-block responsive-block\" data-bs-component=\"generic\" style=\"margin: 0px 0px 4px; border-radius: 8px; overflow: hidden; background: rgb(255, 255, 255); border: 1px solid rgb(228, 231, 237);\">\n<div class=\"image-container\" style=\"position: relative; width: 100%; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px;\">\n<img alt=\"螢幕截圖 2026-07-29 上午10.32.00.png\" src=\"https://tvb-vod-hk.oss-cn-hongkong.aliyuncs.com/uploads/image/2026/07/2026dXqaoIZukg1785294728.png\" style=\"width: 100%; max-width: 100%; height: auto; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px; display: block; object-fit: contain;\" title=\"螢幕截圖 2026-07-29 上午10.32.00.png\"/>\n</div>\n<div class=\"image-caption\" style=\"padding: 8px 12px; background: rgb(245, 247, 250); border-top-width: 1px; border-top-style: solid; border-top-color: rgb(228, 231, 237); font-size: 12px; color: rgb(96, 98, 102); line-height: 1.5;\">\n<span class=\"img-description\">小紅書圖片</span>\n</div>\n</div><div class=\"image-block responsive-block\" data-bs-component=\"generic\" style=\"margin: 0px 0px 4px; border-radius: 8px; overflow: hidden; background: rgb(255, 255, 255); border: 1px solid rgb(228, 231, 237);\">\n<div class=\"image-container\" style=\"position: relative; width: 100%; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px;\">\n<img alt=\"螢幕截圖 2026-07-29 上午10.31.00.png\" src=\"https://tvb-vod-hk.oss-cn-hongkong.aliyuncs.com/uploads/image/2026/07/2026LeyfcjTZs71785294729.png\" style=\"width: 100%; max-width: 100%; height: auto; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px; display: block; object-fit: contain;\" title=\"螢幕截圖 2026-07-29 上午10.31.00.png\"/>\n</div>\n<div class=\"image-caption\" style=\"padding: 8px 12px; background: rgb(245, 247, 250); border-top-width: 1px; border-top-style: solid; border-top-color: rgb(228, 231, 237); font-size: 12px; color: rgb(96, 98, 102); line-height: 1.5;\">\n<span class=\"img-description\">小紅書圖片</span>\n</div>\n</div><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-07-29T06:18:46.314084+00:00","quality":{"score":2,"chars":574,"images":5,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none"}}